Make the topology graph consume the same live client snapshot as /clients.

The topology handler and /clients independently walked the libemcli network
tree. On a live multi-agent model the topology walk consistently omitted the
three clients owned by the co-located controller agent, while /clients and the
controller STAList contained all five. Preserve the topology handler's device,
radio and haul layout, but overlay each node's station list from the successful
live /clients traversal. Retain the band, SSID and MLD metadata as internal
Client fields, and use the last-known-good live snapshot on a transient read
failure.

